      "content": "the legal side is gonna take forever and i don't have the funds for a bunch of specialists right now. i need to establish presence first. can you help me draft a formal 'Letter of Intent' addressed to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs? i want it to sound like it's coming from a recognized head of a house, not just some guy asking for a meeting. it needs to state my intent to re-establish the Valerius diplomatic mission and request a preliminary hearing regarding my status. can you make it sound... authoritative?)",
